## 3. Navigation — Tab-Bar Pattern

The admin nav is **64 px tall** with a horizontal tab bar (different from the 44 px consumer nav-link bar). Copy the full `.nav` / `.tabs` / `.tab` block from `USAdmin/dashboard.html`.

### Logo + admin pill

Per-app pill text (pill CSS is identical for both apps):

```html
<!-- UneraAdmin/*.html -->
<a href="dashboard.html" class="nav-brand" aria-label="UNERA Admin Home">
    <img src="../NewLogo/Unera White Text Nav.svg" alt="UNERA" class="nav-logo-img" height="24">
    <span class="op-pill" aria-label="UNERA Admin portal">UNERA ADMIN</span>
</a>

<!-- USAdmin/*.html -->
<a href="dashboard.html" class="nav-brand" aria-label="UNERA Stablecoin Admin Home">
    <img src="../NewLogo/Unera White Text Nav.svg" alt="UNERA" class="nav-logo-img" height="24">
    <span class="op-pill" aria-label="UNERA Stablecoin Admin portal">UNERA STABLECOIN ADMIN</span>
</a>
```

```css
.op-pill {
    background: var(--brand-cloud-blue);   /* #ebfcf5 — matches alert banner surface */
    color: var(--brand-deep-blue);         /* #173d47 — ~9:1 on cloud-blue; matches stat-value */
    font-size: 0.625rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 980px;
}
```

### Scoped tab sets per app

**UneraAdmin tabs:** Dashboard + HC Management + Users + KYC  
**USAdmin tabs:** Dashboard + Stablecoin Issuance + Proof of Reserve only

The UneraAdmin "Users" tab links to `#user-management` (or `user-management.html` once built) and the "KYC" tab links to `#kyc-management` (or `kyc-management.html` once built). The KYC tab carries a numeric `.tab-badge` showing the pending KYC count (same pattern as the HC Management badge). UneraAdmin owns **HC Management**, **Account Management** (lock/unlock, force password reset), and **KYC Management** (view, update status) per the Feature Tracking roadmap.

Do not add tabs that link to the other app's pages.

### Tab states

```css
.tab        { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
.tab:hover  { color: var(--brand-cloud-blue); }              /* cloud-blue on black = ~18:1 */
.tab.active { color: var(--brand-cloud-blue);
              border-bottom-color: var(--op-accent); }       /* purple underline = admin accent */
```

Focus rings on dark nav elements use `var(--brand-cloud-blue)` (not yellow):
```css
.nav-brand:focus         { outline: 3px solid var(--brand-cloud-blue); }
.tab:focus-visible       { outline: 2px solid var(--brand-cloud-blue); }
.op-user-profile:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--brand-cloud-blue); }
.hamburger:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--brand-cloud-blue); }
.skip-link:focus         { outline: 3px solid var(--brand-cloud-blue); }
```

- Active tab: cloud-blue text (~18:1 on black) + purple underline (admin differentiator)
- HC Management tab badge: `background: var(--brand-cloud-blue); color: var(--brand-deep-blue); border: 2px solid var(--brand-deep-blue);` — deep-blue on cloud-blue ~9:1; never use yellow for badge

### Admin avatar (small + dropdown)

```css
.op-avatar, .op-dropdown-avatar-lg {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-purple) 55%, var(--brand-earth));
    color: var(--brand-white);   /* white on purple-earth mix — passes contrast */
}
```

Dropdown header background: `var(--surface-operator)`.

