## 4. Alert Banners (no CSS gradients)

| State | Background | Border | CTA |
|---|---|---|---|
| Needs-Attention (warning) | `var(--brand-cloud-blue)` | `1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-deep-blue) 12%, transparent)` | **black** fill / **white** text |
| Reserve-warning (error) | `var(--surface-error-soft)` | `1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-red) 22%, transparent)` | **black** fill / **white** text |

```css
.alert-cta {
    background: var(--brand-black);
    color: var(--brand-white);    /* white on black = 21:1 contrast */
}
.alert-cta:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }
.alert-cta:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--brand-black); outline-offset: 2px; }
```

Text color on both banners: `var(--brand-deep-blue)`. Never use orange or red gradients.  
Icons: `warning` FILL=1 for attention banners, `error` FILL=1 for reserve-warning (both from `newunera-icons.mdc`).

