## 14. What NOT to Do

- ❌ No `linear-gradient` / `radial-gradient` — use `color-mix` surfaces and solid tokens
- ❌ No V1 hex colors (`#10B981`, `#0EA5E9`, `#EC4899`)
- ❌ No Space Grotesk — TestFoundersGrotesk only
- ❌ No `stroke=` on SVGs — Material Symbols use `fill="currentColor"` only
- ❌ No `font-weight: 800` or `900` — max 700
- ❌ No `--neutral-500` as text ink — use `--text-secondary` (`#3d6b78`)
- ❌ No yellow or light-blue text on warm/white surfaces (WCAG 1.4.3)
- ❌ No consumer-app patterns (e.g. `--gradient-primary` gradient text titles, old nav height 44px) — use admin-specific 64px tab-bar nav
- ❌ Never save admin pages outside `NewUnera/UneraAdmin/` or `NewUnera/USAdmin/`
- ❌ Never use `--gradient-ink` (deep-blue) for the admin nav or primary action card — use `--op-nav` (black) for both
- ❌ Never use `--fin-up` green for admin workflow badges — use `--brand-cloud-blue` background / `--brand-deep-blue` text
- ❌ Never use deep-blue for the alert CTA on admin banners — use `var(--brand-black)` fill with `var(--brand-white)` text (21:1 contrast)
- ❌ Never use `var(--brand-yellow)` anywhere in admin portal chrome — yellow is not part of the admin color scheme; use `var(--brand-cloud-blue)` for nav active/hover and white for button text
- ❌ Never use `var(--gradient-warm)` as the needs-attention banner background — use `var(--brand-cloud-blue)` (#ebfcf5)
- ❌ Never use `color: var(--brand-deep-blue)` for `.page-title` — use `var(--text-primary)` to stay aligned with `.stat-value`
- ❌ Never add cross-app tab links (UneraAdmin tabs must not link to `issuance.html`/`por.html`; USAdmin tabs must not link to `hc-management.html`/`hc-edit.html`/`user-management.html`/`kyc-management.html`)
- ❌ Never add stablecoin/treasury KPIs (Total Issued, Reserve Ratio, Last Mint) to UneraAdmin pages — those belong to USAdmin only
- ❌ Never add Mint Tokens or View PoR actions to UneraAdmin pages — those are USAdmin-only operations
